## CORS Configuration
```go
app.Use(cors.New(cors.Config{
    AllowOrigins:     "https://yourdomain.com,http://localhost:4200",
    AllowMethods:     "GET,POST,PUT,PATCH,DELETE,OPTIONS",
    AllowHeaders:     "Content-Type,Authorization",
    AllowCredentials: true,
    MaxAge:           86400,
}))
```

## File Upload Rules
- Photos: `multipart/form-data`, max 5MB per file, accepted MIME: `image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/webp`
- Store on filesystem or object storage (configurable via env); never in DB as BLOB
- Return relative URL path in response; frontend constructs full URL from `MEDIA_BASE_URL`

## Streaming Export (Admin)
```go
// XML export — stream directly, don't buffer all records
c.Set("Content-Type", "application/xml; charset=utf-8")
c.Set("Content-Disposition", `attachment; filename="events.xml"`)
encoder := xml.NewEncoder(c.Response().BodyWriter())
// write records in batches of 100
```
